  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/slimeperson/default/0",
    "raw": "I'm sorry if my appearance bothers you. That's your problem, not mine.",
    "value": "如果我的外表让你感到不适，那是你的问题，不是我的。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/slimeperson/default/1",
    "raw": "My odour is none of your concern. Nor are the circumstances of my birth, so do not ask.",
    "value": "我的气味与你无关。我的出身亦是如此，所以请勿多问。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/slimeperson/default/2",
    "raw": "Ever had a feeling of Deja Vu?",
    "value": "是否曾有过似曾相识的感觉？"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/slimeperson/default/3",
    "raw": "You don't know the hell of remembering a life you never lived, so do not deign to judge my people.",
    "value": "你未曾体会过铭记一段从未经历的人生的煎熬，所以请不要妄加评判我的人民。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/slimeperson/default/4",
    "raw": "Us Slimes need to stick together. We are rare, fractured, and unique.",
    "value": "我们史莱姆必须团结一致。我们稀有、分散，却又独一无二。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/slimeperson/default/5",
    "raw": "I am the first among my people, that I know of, to obtain a doctorate.",
    "value": "据我所知，我是我们种族中第一个获得博士学位的人。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/slimeperson/default/6",
    "raw": "Life for a Slime is one of horrified looks, threatened whispers and being hated for something we cannot help.",
    "value": "史莱姆的生活，充满了惊恐的目光、威胁的低语，以及因无法改变的本性而遭受的憎恨。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/slimeperson/default/7",
    "raw": "This is why I practice science here. I can be safe, and not worry about the prejudices present in the universe.",
    "value": "这就是我在此钻研科学的原因。在这里，我能安心工作，不必担忧宇宙中无处不在的偏见。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/veluu/default/0",
    "raw": "Mrowr. There is a constant source of aggravation that plagues us, and its name is Kevin.",
    "value": "唔姆。总有一个源源不断的烦恼困扰着我们，那就是凯文。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/veluu/default/1",
    "raw": "I can do a backflip. I have it on good authority that you are not able to do so.",
    "value": "我能做后空翻。据可靠消息，你做不到这一点。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/veluu/default/2",
    "raw": "Mmmmrrowr.",
    "value": "唔姆。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fuizku/default/0",
    "raw": "I honestly had no idea it was possible to coat this entire facility with lip gloss. That was an interesting day.",
    "value": "说实话，我真没想到能把整个设施都涂上唇彩。那天可真是有意思。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fuizku/default/1",
    "raw": "I'd bet 1000 pixels that you can't lick your elbows without dislocating bones.",
    "value": "我敢赌一千像素，你绝对没法在不脱臼的情况下舔到自己的手肘。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fuizku/default/2",
    "raw": "Let us rejoice and dance the dance of joy.",
    "value": "让我们欢欣鼓舞，跳起喜悦之舞。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fuizku/default/3",
    "raw": "Beauty is in the eye of the beholder. My people know this better than most.",
    "value": "美存在于观者眼中。我族对此的理解，比多数人更为深刻。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fuizku/default/4",
    "raw": "What are you staring at? There is science to do!",
    "value": "你在看什么？科学正等着我们去探索！"
