  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fuanodyne/default/1",
    "raw": "Watch your step. I hear Kevin has been hiding weird crap all over the station again.",
    "value": "小心脚下。听说凯文又在站点各处藏了些奇怪的东西。"
