    "value": "又是一天，又是一块钱。外加一个烦人的恶作剧。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fuanodyne/default/3",
    "raw": "Ever seen a Garflipp? They are weird worms capable of psionic cleansing...something no other known species can accomplish.",
