  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/avian/default/4",
    "raw": "And don't spew that cop-out 'magic' nonsense. There's no such thing!",
    "value": "别再用“魔法”这种借口来搪塞了。根本不存在这种东西！"
  },
  {
